# Test your FastAPI + AIML Integration Endpoints

### 1. Root Service Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

### 2. System Health & AIML Model Readiness Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. AI Metadata (Supported Event Types & Categories)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ai/metadata
Accept: application/json

### 4. AI Vendor Recommendation - Wedding ($35,000 budget, 150 guests)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ai/recommend-vendors
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "event_type": "Wedding",
  "client_budget": 35000.0,
  "guest_count": 150
}

### 5. AI Vendor Recommendation - Corporate Conference ($60,000 budget, 400 guests)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ai/recommend-vendors
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "event_type": "Conference",
  "client_budget": 60000.0,
  "guest_count": 400
}

### 6. Predict Category Budget Allocation Breakdown
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ai/predict-budget
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "event_type": "Wedding",
  "client_budget": 30000.0,
  "guest_count": 120
}

### 7. Query Vendor Catalog (Filter by Category)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/vendors?category=Catering
Accept: application/json

### 8. Create Event with AI-Recommended Vendors (Create Event Tab Integration)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/create-with-ai
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "eventName": "Tech Summit 2026",
  "eventType": "Conference",
  "clientBudget": 45000.0,
  "guestCount": 250,
  "startDate": "2026-11-15",
  "endDate": "2026-11-16",
  "preferredPackage": "recommended"
}

### 9. AI Vendor Price Negotiation (Single Vendor)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ai/negotiate-vendor-price
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "vendor_id": "CAT-001",
  "guest_count": 150,
  "target_budget": 9500.0,
  "has_flexible_date": true,
  "has_early_deposit": true
}

### 10. AI Vendor Price Negotiation (Custom / Sample Vendor with Payload)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ai/negotiate-vendor-price
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "vendor_id": "vendor-photo-custom",
  "guest_count": 100,
  "target_budget": 3000.0,
  "has_flexible_date": true,
  "has_early_deposit": true,
  "vendor_data": {
    "id": "vendor-photo-custom",
    "name": "Cinematic Moments",
    "category": "Photography",
    "tier": "Moderate",
    "base_fee": 1200.0,
    "per_person_rate": 18.0,
    "estimated_cost": 3000.0
  }
}

### 11. AI Bundle-Wide Price Negotiation (Multi-Vendor Package)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ai/negotiate-bundle
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "bundle": {
    "bundle_name": "Recommended Package",
    "total_cost": 25000.0,
    "client_budget": 30000.0,
    "guest_count": 120,
    "event_type": "Wedding",
    "vendors": [
      {
        "vendor_id": "CAT-001",
        "vendor_name": "Royal Feast Catering",
        "category": "Catering",
        "tier": "Moderate",
        "estimated_cost": 10950.0,
        "budget_allocated": 9500.0
      },
      {
        "vendor_id": "PHO-001",
        "vendor_name": "Artisan Lens Studio",
        "category": "Photography",
        "tier": "Moderate",
        "estimated_cost": 3800.0,
        "budget_allocated": 3500.0
      }
    ]
  },
  "has_flexible_date": true,
  "has_early_deposit": true
}
